0010: 
0011:     Input structure
0012:     - The grid is a black canvas containing only blue foreground pixels.
0013:     - Every blue pixel belongs to a horizontal dashed bar whose blue pixels are separated by one black gap.
0014: 
0015:     Rule
0016:     - Preserve all input pixels.
